<</Type/Annot/Subtype/Highlight/C[.55 .85 .45]/P 143 0 R/F 4/QuadPoints[218.30352 645.693 299.21067 645.693 218.30352 634.9355 299.21067 634.9355]/Rect[215.76786 634.2631 301.7463 646.36538]/AP<</N 1023 0 R>>/NM(fitz-A0)/Contents(Credit: the euro-area data is accurate throughout and well-sourced. GDP -0.2% q/q Q1, HICP 3.2% May \(from 3.0% April\), the ECB June projections, the +25bp on 11 June, unemployment 6.3%, hourly labour costs 3.2%, and the France/Italy/Spain/Greece 2025 debt ratios all match the primary sources. This half of the paper needs no factual changes.)/T(Francesco di Fano & Claude)/BM/Multiply>>
endobj

