<</Type/Annot/Subtype/Highlight/C[1 .8 .25]/P 532 0 R/F 4/QuadPoints[390.96 512.84909 508.98606 512.84909 390.96 502.09153 508.98606 502.09153]/Rect[388.42433 501.4192 511.52174 513.5214]/AP<</N 1031 0 R>>/NM(fitz-A0)/Contents(Enter this line by ISIN only. The ISIN IE00BF8J5974 is correct \(Xtrackers USD Corp Bond Short Duration SRI PAB, 0.16%\), but the ticker 'XYLD' is also the Global X S&P 500 Covered Call ETF, a US equity fund, so ordering by the bare ticker risks buying the wrong instrument. Small fund too \(~EUR 71m\), worth a liquidity check for real sizing.)/T(Francesco di Fano & Claude)/BM/Multiply>>
