1038 0 obj
<</Type/Annot/Subtype/Text/Rect[500 730.92 516 746.92]/C[.15 .35 .7]/Popup 1039 0 R/P 654 0 R/F 28/Contents(OVERALL ASSESSMENT \(Francesco di Fano & Claude\)\n\nThe euro-area analysis is accurate and well-sourced \(GDP -0.2% Q1, HICP 3.2%/3.0%, the ECB June projections, the +25bp decision, unemployment, labour costs, and the France/Italy/Spain/Greece debt ratios all check out\), the construction is coherent, and the instrument identifiers verify.\n\nRECOMMENDATION: Approve, with one required fix and a few smaller ones.\nRequired: the US 'core PCE' exhibit \(Section 2.3.2.1\) is mislabelled and its figures are wrong \(see the note there\).\nSmaller: correct the euro-area debt ratio to 87.8%; correct the IBCL duration to ~15.9y; resolve the 'TBC' 7-10yr anchor \(IE00B3VWN518\); enter the XYLD line by ISIN; fix the 'three limitations' count and the missing appendix.\nPositions and instruments are sound and can proceed; the core-PCE exhibit should be corrected before this is circulated as final.)/Name/Note/AP<</N 1040 0 R>>/NM(fitz-A0)/T(Francesco di Fano & Claude)>>
endobj

